Package: nftban-api
Version: 2.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nftban (>= 1.0.0), systemd, libpam0g
Build-Depends: golang-go (>= 1.21)
Maintainer: NFTBan Team <noreply@nftban.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/nftban/nftban
Description: NFTBan Web API - Modern web interface for NFTBan firewall
 NFTBan Web API v2.0 provides a modern REST API and responsive web interface
 for managing the NFTBan firewall system.
 .
 Features:
  - Memory-only session management (no database)
  - PAM authentication with role-based access control (RBAC)
  - Mobile-responsive web interface with 4 pages
  - Real-time metrics integration
  - HTTPS on port 3940
  - WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility compliant
  - Gemini AI reviewed and optimized
